        <div class="slideshow__text-wrapper banner__content banner__content--bottom-left page-width banner--desktop-transparent">
          <div class="slideshow__text banner__box content-container content-container--full-width-mobile color-accent-2 gradient slideshow__text--left slideshow__text-mobile--center"><h2 class="banner__heading inline-richtext h1">
                feel-good essential oil candles for golden-hour souls
              </h2><div class="banner__text rte">
                <p>Sun-warmed skin. Citrus groves in the distance. A golden-hour ride through Italy, where summer clings to your clothes. <a href="https://littlekarmaco.com/products/vespa-brightening-candle" title="Preorder: Vespa brightening limited edition 2-wick candle">Vespa</a> is your Italian love story - zesty, sun-drenched, sultry and warm. Subscribers save £10: sign up now.</p>
              </div><div class="banner__buttons">
                <a href="https://littlekarmaco.com/products/vespa-brightening-candle" class="button button--primary">limited edition: pre-order now</a>
              </div></div>
        </div>
      </div></div></slideshow-component>
</section><section id="shopify-section-template--24702983012676__newsletter_T8QqzQ" class="shopify-section section"><link href="./Luxury Refillable Candles _ Sustainable &amp; Personalised Gifts – Little Karma Co_files/component-newsletter.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" media="all">
