    <div class="rich-text__wrapper rich-text__wrapper--center page-width">
      <div class="rich-text__blocks center"><h2 class="rich-text__heading rte inline-richtext h1">
                how our refillable candles work
              </h2><div class="rich-text__text rte">
                <p>Simply purchase your favourite <a href="https://littlekarmaco.com/collections/signature-scents" title="Signature Scents">refillable candle</a>, and make sure to choose matching candle refill add-ons to <strong>enjoy 20% off </strong>sustainable luxury that lasts. Our <a href="https://littlekarmaco.com/collections/candle-refills" title="Candle refills">candle refills</a> come in a range of scents crafted with aromatherapy benefits - boost focus, calm your mind, or uplift your mood.</p><p>Thousands of happy customers love our refillable candles for their quality, sustainability, and style. Light a candle that cares for your home and the planet.</p><p>Browse our full collection of refillable candles and find your perfect scent today.</p>
              </div><div class="rich-text__buttons"><a href="https://littlekarmaco.com/collections/signature-scents" class="button button--primary">join the refill revolution</a></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


